          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC01_D_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "This all but confirms my theories about Gobbler physiology! It's also an insight into our history that none of us know. We must inform the others!",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Alphoi_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Rosina_003_88.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1487174,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC01_D_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I need some time to process the information stored in the holo-disk. Could you go out and tell the Gobblers what we've learned?",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Alphoi_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Rosina_003_89.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1487174,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC01_D_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And while you're at it, use your powers of persuasion to motivate them to do something. Anything! Tell them it's the only way they'll get fed!",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Alphoi_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Rosina_003_90.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1487174,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC01_D_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "How'd your motivational speaking go, kiddo? Wow! I'm impressed you were so successful, much less not eaten. I was pretty successful here too.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Alphoi_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Rosina_003_91.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1487174,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC01_D_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The information on this Holo-disk was invaluable. I was able to use it to map out the perfect Gobbler food for our unique physiology and tastes.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Alphoi_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Rosina_003_92.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1487174,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC01_D_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The key is Fairy-Dusted organic ingredients. None of the low-fructose candy corn syrup junk Nana uses. The trick is going to be manufacturing...",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Alphoi_WitchF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Rosina_003_93.mp3",
